# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# --- Dependencies ---
**/node_modules/

# --- Python ---
**/.venv/
**/.dockervenv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.egg-info/
*.egg
dist/
build/

# --- Backend ---
backend/poetry.lock
backend/test_router.js
**/views/test
**/components.d.ts

# --- DB ---
*.sql~
*.dump
*.bak

# --- Docker volumes (data は除外、.gitkeep は保持) ---
volumes/db/init/data/*
!volumes/db/init/data/.gitkeep

# --- Certificates ---
*.cert
*.key

# --- Env files ---
*.env
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.production

# --- Logs ---
*.log

# --- IDE / Editor ---
.claude
.cursor
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
.geminiignore
AGENTS.md

# --- docs ---
**/docs/